{"id":"a74a9caa29e2a312","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-fixed-point-theorem.md","title":"Modal Fixed Point Theorem","display":"thm-fixed-point-theorem — Modal Fixed Point Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-fixed-point-theorem","aliases":["89-thm-fixed-point-theorem"],"display":"thm-fixed-point-theorem — Modal Fixed Point Theorem","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-df-fixed-point-modal]]","[[89-df-modalized-formula]]","[[89-df-box-modality]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-fixed-point-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-fixed-point-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-fixed-point-theorem — Modal Fixed Point Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"02536e2efd437c59\" href=\"?note=02536e2efd437c59\" title=\"89-df-fixed-point-modal\">89-df-fixed-point-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d8f6cb40eba269af\" href=\"?note=d8f6cb40eba269af\" title=\"89-df-modalized-formula\">89-df-modalized-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal{M}_{\\Box,p}\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal{M}_{\\Box,p}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> is the GL fixed-point set.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal{M}_{\\Box,p}\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\ne\\varnothing\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal{M}_{\\Box,p}\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\ne\\varnothing\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> : GL逻辑 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span> : 模态算子 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a>)</li>\n<li>GL中每个带Box约束的公式都有不动点</li>\n<li>这是解Gödel句子和Henkin句子的模态方法</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-fixed-point-modal","status":"resolved","id":"02536e2efd437c59","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-fixed-point-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modalized-formula","status":"resolved","id":"d8f6cb40eba269af","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modalized-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-box-modality","status":"resolved","id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-box-modality]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GL}$ : GL逻辑 (see [[89-df-gl-logic]])","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-box-modality","status":"resolved","id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\Box$ : 模态算子 (see [[89-df-box-modality]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal{M}_{\\Box,p}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal{M}_{\\Box,p}\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\ne\\varnothing\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box","display":false}],"bytes":979,"backlinks":[{"id":"1cd2a39dee160249","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d02a2af901e8720d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-136","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-thm-arithmetical-completeness-full.md]]\n[[89-thm-arithmetical-completeness.md]]\n[[89-thm-canonical-model-gl.md]]\n[[89-thm-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[89-thm-fixed-point-theorem.md]]\n[[89-thm-fmp-gl.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-completeness-arithmetical.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-completeness-kripke.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-completeness.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-decidability.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-decida